  </title>
  <description type="4">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Active</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The current proposal seeks to fast-track the implementation of the SAFE Initiative by prioritizing key projects with high potential for success and financing. These identified projects will receive targeted technical assistance and comprehensive studies aimed at making them bankable at an accelerated pace. By addressing pressing needs upfront, this approach ensures efficient utilization of resources and timely progress towards achieving the initiative&apos;s goals.</narrative>
  </description>
